    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Distinguish clearly between RAM (volatile) and ROM (non-volatile) characteristics for standard multiple-choice questions.",
        "Cache memory placement and speed relative to CPU and main memory is a highly repeated topic.",
        "Conversion problems involving Memory Units (Bytes, KB, MB, GB, TB) frequently appear in exams.",
        "Be prepared to compare Primary and Secondary Memory on parameters like speed, cost, access type, and volatility."
      ],
